  verified-against: the real installed package, executed via node (20000-case
    differential fuzz vs a spec reimplementation: 0 mismatches; plus targeted
    edge probes for coercion, unicode sizing, truncation, empty/null chars,
    Infinity, and the MAX_SAFE_INTEGER throw boundary).
